<title>BRAZIL: Brazil sells dlrs at 1.0640 in floating market.</title>
<headline>Brazil sells dlrs at 1.0640 in floating market.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Central Bank sold dollars at 1.0640 reais per greenback in a sell tender in the interbank floating foreign exchange rate market, dealers said.</p>
<p>((-- Alexandre Caverni, Sao Paulo newsroon, 55 11 2485418))</p>
